From 30fa334d533b04aea9c2094b8f91544cc3dff259 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 21:07:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper_diag: the banner comment names the version the script
 actually is

The header comment still said v1.3.10 (2026-08-30) while VER= has been 1.3.13 since the v3.0.5 rung. Cosmetic: nothing reads the comment, the marker pins VER=. Closes the note left in the v3.0.5 pick-up record.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/others/reaper_diag | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/others/reaper_diag b/release/src/router/others/reaper_diag
index 30d8f7aadb..5c8b2db06e 100644
--- a/release/src/router/others/reaper_diag
+++ b/release/src/router/others/reaper_diag
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 #!/bin/sh
 # ============================================================================
-#  REAPER-DIAG v1.3.10 (2026-08-30) - sanitized one-shot diagnostic bundle
+#  REAPER-DIAG v1.3.13 (2026-09-02) - sanitized one-shot diagnostic bundle
 #  Runs on ANY Reaper model (RT-BE96U / RT-BE86U / RT-BE88U / GT-BE98 /
 #  GT-BE98_PRO) - radios, ports and features are discovered at runtime.
 #
-- 
2.25.1

